          "aliases": "Tomas, Vance, The Surveyor",
          "role": "Protagonist · Senior Hydrographer",
          "motivation": "Prove the archipelago's seabed shifts along predictable fault lines before winter shipping resumes.",
          "appearance": "Weathered wool peacoat, ink-stained knuckles, brass caliper on a leather lanyard.",
          "notes": "Lost his first sloop off the Outer Stacks seven years prior."
